---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import resources from '../data/gated-resources.json';
interface Props {resource:typeof resources[number]}
const {resource}=Astro.props;
---
<section class="gated-resource wrap" data-resource-gate>
 <div class="gate-intro"><span class="eyebrow">{resource.eyebrow}</span><h1>{resource.headline}</h1><p class="gate-summary">{resource.intro}</p>
 <div class="datasheet-cover" aria-hidden="true"><div class="sheet-cover-top"><span>TRACEGATE</span><span>01 / PLATFORM</span></div><div class="sheet-cover-title">See the path.<br/><span>Stop the breach.</span></div><div class="sheet-cover-route"><span><Icon name="cloud" size={29}/></span><i></i><span><Icon name="fingerprint" size={29}/></span><i></i><span><Icon name="database" size={29}/></span></div><div class="sheet-cover-bottom"><span>CLOUD + IDENTITY. CONNECTED.</span><span>DATA SHEET</span></div></div>
 <p class="gate-format">{resource.format} <span>·</span> Product concept</p><h2>Inside the data sheet</h2><ul class="gate-takeaways">{resource.takeaways.map(item=><li><Icon name="check" size={17}/><span>{item}</span></li>)}</ul></div>
 <div class="gate-form-column"><form class="contact-form gate-form" data-gate-form action="#resource-access" method="get"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR COPY IS READY</span><h2>Get the platform overview.</h2><p>Try the demo access form. Required fields are marked with an asterisk. Example details work.</p><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="resource-first-name">First name *</label><input id="resource-first-name" autocomplete="given-name" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Alex"/></div><div class="field"><label for="resource-last-name">Last name *</label><input id="resource-last-name" autocomplete="family-name" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Morgan"/></div></div><div class="field"><label for="resource-email">Work email *</label><input type="email" id="resource-email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="180" placeholder="alex@example.com"/></div><div class="field"><label for="resource-company">Company *</label><input id="resource-company" autocomplete="organization" required maxlength="120" placeholder="Example company"/></div><button class="button" type="submit">View the data sheet<Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={16}/></button><p class="form-note">Portfolio demo. No information is submitted, saved, or used to contact you. This demonstrates an access flow. <a href="/privacy/">Privacy notice</a>.</p><noscript><p class="form-note">This demo form requires JavaScript. <a href={resource.download} download>Download the data sheet directly</a>.</p></noscript></form><p class="gate-footnote"><Icon name="lock" size={14}/> A demo access experience. No real lead collection.</p></div>
 <section class="resource-access" id="resource-access" data-gate-result hidden aria-labelledby="resource-access-title"><div class="resource-access-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">ACCESS READY / DEMO COMPLETE</span><h2 id="resource-access-title" tabindex="-1">Your platform overview.</h2><p role="status">The data sheet is ready. Your form information was not submitted or saved.</p></div><a class="button" href={resource.download} download>Download the PDF<Icon name="download" size={17}/></a></div><article class="datasheet-content"><div class="datasheet-content-top"><span class="meta">TRACEGATE / PLATFORM DATA SHEET</span><span class="meta">FICTIONAL PRODUCT CONCEPT</span></div><h3>Cloud + identity, in context.</h3><p>{resource.summary}</p><div class="datasheet-capabilities">{resource.capabilities.map(item=><section><Icon name={item.icon} size={25}/><h4>{item.title}</h4><p>{item.copy}</p></section>)}</div><h3>A connected workflow.</h3><div class="datasheet-workflow">{resource.workflow.map((item,i)=><section><span class="meta">0{i+1}</span><h4>{item.title}</h4><p>{item.copy}</p></section>)}</div><p class="datasheet-boundary">{resource.boundary}</p></article><div class="resource-access-footer"><a class="text-link" href="/platform/">Explore the interactive platform<Icon name="arrow-right" size={17}/></a><button class="text-link gate-reset" type="button" data-gate-reset>Try the form again<Icon name="arrow-left" size={16}/></button></div></section>
</section>
